" 3 putaran."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:278
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Dodge freely in your half. First to 10. Best of 3 rounds."
msgstr ""
"Menghindar bebas di setengah Anda. Pertama sampai 10. Terbaik dari 3 "
"putaran."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:83
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Dogfight in the void"
